data: {"id": "78446641edcb4999-final", "run_id": "78446641edcb4999", "seq": 962, "ts_ms": 1789148765936, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中缺少 Pod 定义所依赖的 'unavailable-key' 键，导致 kubelet 无法完成容器配置并持续报 CreateContainerConfigError。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `reason=CreateContainerConfigError, message=\"couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input\"` | 确认容器启动失败的直接机制：配置项校验未通过 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Event Failed, message=\"couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input\"` (频率: x12 over 58m) | 提供因果候选，证实 kubelet 周期性校验失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status.phase=\"Pending\", condition Ready=False, ContainersReady=False` | 描述现象：Pod 处于挂起且未就绪状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 独立观测：验证了 Pod 持续处于配置报错等待状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n- K8s Event (fact-076d1bd30fbe) 明确指出缺失 `unavailable-key` 键，导致容器无法启动 (fact-c5cf74e69e5b, fact-cf426129b4eb)。\n- Prometheus Metric (fact-2e92632a32e4) 的 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态与 K8s 事实一致，排除了瞬时网络问题或 API Server 异常，证实该配置问题是持续存在的。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 缺少 'unavailable-key' 键 → kubelet 读取配置失败，拒绝启动容器 → 容器持续报错并回退等待 → Pod 状态变为 Pending 且不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：`ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中缺失了 Pod 定义所依赖的 `unavailable-key` 键。\n\n该缺失导致 `kubelet` 在配置容器环境时失败，触发 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态（证据 1, 2, 4）。因此，Pod 处于 `Pending` 且未就绪状态（证据 3），服务无法访问。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 52.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 52.6s (Evidence 45.7s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.425, "metrics": {"run_id": "78446641edcb4999", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.42797636985779, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 85427.97636985779, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 72970.29781341553, "tool_calls": 25, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 22, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 23230.315446853638, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 12094.666004180908}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24882.36403465271, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 52604.469537734985, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7919.7447299957275, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

